			"type": "Markdown",
			"text": "**Short answer: a clean `\"1.5\"` works, but `convert` isn't safe to feed raw form input.** It never checks the amount. JavaScript quietly turns the string into a number when it multiplies, so good input works by accident, and bad input returns a wrong number instead of an error."
